# Always More Quoth the Ravenous (adoulin, call-only), the talk's gates at fame level 3: a level 99 Warrior in
# Western Adoulin, Hunger Strikes and The Starving completed (GMs), 125 Adoulin fame, Westerly_Breeze_Wait 99999 (a GM:
# nothing in the game sets it), Vana'diel day 8000. Talks go in pairs (553, then his script). An Apple Juice and a
# Cursed Beverage while available: nothing (the trade arms need the quest accepted). The wait day ahead: nothing from
# the script. The wait var at today (8000, a GM): nothing (the day must be past it). The wait var 7999 (a GM): 3010,
# finished on 0: added (any option). The Cursed Beverage: 3012, finished: completed, Westerly_Breeze_Wait 0.
lists WesternAdoulin/Westerly_Breeze/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Westerly_Breeze/onTrade WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/3010 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/3012
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=63.5,32,123 job=WAR lvl=99
fame Adoulin 125
quest Adoulin.HungerStrikes completed
quest Adoulin.TheStarving completed
charvar Westerly_Breeze_Wait 99999
item BottleOfAppleJuice
item BottleOfCursedBeverage
login
trade Westerly_Breeze BottleOfAppleJuice x1   # a drink while available: nothing
trade Westerly_Breeze BottleOfCursedBeverage x1  # the beverage while available: nothing
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # 553
finish-if-event
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # the wait day ahead: nothing: 553
finish-if-event
charvar Westerly_Breeze_Wait 8000       # a GM: today
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # 553
finish-if-event
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # the wait day today: nothing: 553
finish-if-event
charvar Westerly_Breeze_Wait 7999       # a GM: yesterday
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # 553
finish-if-event option=0
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # the wait day past: 3010
finish-if-event option=0                # added
trade Westerly_Breeze BottleOfCursedBeverage x1  # accepted: 3012
finish                                  # completed, Westerly_Breeze_Wait 0
